        { "flag": "safeOpen", "value": true },
        { "score": 10 },
        { "win": "You spin the dial to ${combo}. The safe clunks and swings open. Inside: the cash box, a stack of deeds, and the ring of little panel keys that never leaves Marge's belt. Except that it is here, and the Block Drop key is missing from it. Marge sees it at the same moment you do. (To be continued: the slice ends here.)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-safe",
